        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: We have the following subarrays:\n\n[2][2][2], for which f([2])=[2]f([2]) = [2]f([2])=[2] has a value of 2⋅30=22\\cdot 3^0 = 22⋅30=2.\n[1][1][1], for which f([1])=[1]f([1]) = [1]f([1])=[1] has a value of 1⋅30=11\\cdot 3^0 = 11⋅30=1.\n[2,1][2, 1][2,1], for which f([2,1])=[0]f([2, 1]) = [0]f([2,1])=[0] has a value of 0⋅30=00\\cdot 3^0 = 00⋅30=0.\n\nThe sum of all values is 2+1+0=32+1+0 = 32+1+0=3."
